  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Christmas for 200 families in a Lagos slum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our community impact Christmas project makes Christmas possible for families with low or no income, who are experiencing poverty and cannot afford to put decent  meals on the table or provide Christmas gifts for their children. Every family deserves to experience the love, hope and joy of the season and children should feel loved, special and valued in the joyful spirit of the holiday season. Our goal is to  support 200 underprivileged families in our community to not go hungry this Christmas.</narrative>
  </description>
